# merge_base 207716440, ahead 1, files 2/2/1/2 (asserted per PR, exit 10). Pairwise file-disjoint (7 files). Every PR file is byte-identical to its
# CANONICAL local-model patch (the run's out.md.checker/section_N.diff + section_N.opts, re-applied by the generator). Every merge is clean: each PR over
# develop (a fast-forward), each over a SIMULATED develop+#922 squash, and all four together (d69d10e35 over develop, dd54cab00 over develop+#922).
